          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 89455,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comment peut-on réutiliser un ensemble ?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nous le sauvegardons dans une variable</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nous ne pouvons pas le réutiliser, nous pouvons seulement l'afficher</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nous le sauvegardons dans une variable.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nous enregistrons un set dans une variable lorsque nous voulons le réutiliser.</p><p>Quelle ligne stocke un set dans <code>colors</code> ?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colors = {\"red\", \"blue\"}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print({\"red\", \"blue\"})</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors == {\"red\", \"blue\"}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>colors = {\"red\", \"blue\"}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Intro 2",
            "id": 89457,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assigne un ensemble valide à la variable <code>cities</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cities = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kyoto&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Oslo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{&quot;Kyoto&quot;, &quot;Kyoto&quot;, &quot;Oslo&quot;}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>{\"Kyoto\", \"Oslo\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stocke <code>\"Kyoto\"</code> et <code>\"Oslo\"</code> dans un set nommé <code>cities</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cities = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kyoto&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Oslo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;Kyoto&quot;, &quot;Oslo&quot;]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;Kyoto&quot;, &quot;Oslo&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>{\"Kyoto\", \"Oslo\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Curly braces",
            "id": 89458,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code un ensemble de nombres pairs, entourés d'accolades.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"even_nums = {\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(even_nums)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{0, 2, 4, 6}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>{</code> suivi de <code>0, 2, 4, 6</code> et enfin <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crée un set de nombres pairs afin que le code affiche <code>{0, 2, 4, 6}</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"even_nums = {\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(even_nums)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{0, 2, 4, 6}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>{</code> suivi de <code>0, 2, 4, 6</code> et enfin <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
