            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code les éléments <code>\"french\"</code>, suivi de <code>\"ballet\"</code> séparés par une virgule.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"classes = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;french&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(classes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"29\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'french', 'ballet'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de rentrer <code>\"french\", \"ballet\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
