            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stocke un set à une valeur contenant <code>\"homework\"</code> dans <code>tasks</code> afin que le code affiche <code>{'homework'}</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tasks = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;homework&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tasks)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'homework'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>tasks</code> suivi de <code>=</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>\"homework\"</code> et enfin <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
